WEBVTT

00:10:28.158 --> 00:10:32.228
And once you've consciously become aware
of either your thoughts, emotions

00:10:32.262 --> 00:10:33.696
or physical sensations,

00:10:33.696 --> 00:10:35.832
well then you can practice
either technique.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.269
These may be common concepts,

00:10:39.302 --> 00:10:42.305
but I'll tell you they're definitely
not commonly practiced.

00:10:43.072 --> 00:10:45.608
So by remembering
the jumping cholla effect,

00:10:45.608 --> 00:10:48.344
it will help you to be more
self-aware and self-regulated.

00:10:48.344 --> 00:10:51.814
And in turn, well,
you'll avoid getting pricked by ...

00:10:51.814 --> 00:10:53.516
a prick.

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:54.784
Thank you.